THOUGHT: Let's make a cleaner modification by rewriting the entire `BaseApplication` class initialization part:

```bash
sed -i '/class BaseApplication:/,/def do_load_config(/{
    /def __init__/,/self.do_load_config()/{
        /self.cfg = None/d
        /self.do_load_config()/i\
        self._cfg = None
    }
}' gunicorn/app/base.py
```

